Output docs/media/cli-run.gif
Set Shell zsh
Set FontSize 13
Set Width 1500
Set Height 950
Set Padding 16
Set TypingSpeed 25ms
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"

Hide
Type "cd /Users/anthony/b2b-agent-portfolio/ai-account-manager && clear"
Enter
Sleep 800ms
Show

Type "aam seed"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type "aam score"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type "aam brief --am alice@cyberco.com"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 6s
